{%- comment -%}
  Sous-navigation de l'espace Learn — source unique des URL et des libelles.

  Ne produit plus que la barre collante en tete des pages Learn. Les variantes
  `header` et `mobile` ont ete retirees : le mega-menu de header.liquid porte
  desormais l'entree Apprendre, et deux menus concurrents s'affichaient.

  Parametre :
    current  'hub' | 'benefits' | 'how' | 'wavelengths' | 'science' | 'howto' | 'faq'
             | 'values' | 'blog'

  Trilingue FR / EN / PT, comme le header.

  Resolution des URL — les pages sont creees dans l'admin Shopify, le theme ne
  peut pas les creer. On lit l'objet page par son handle : son `.url` porte
  deja le prefixe de locale (/fr/pages/...). Si la page manque, on retombe sur
  un chemin construit a la main plutot que sur un href vide, qui rechargerait
  la page courante sans rien signaler.

  Les handles sont ceux reellement crees en boutique. Un handle qui change ne
  se corrige qu'ici.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign is_fr = false
  assign is_pt = false
  if request.locale.iso_code contains 'fr'
    assign is_fr = true
  endif
  if request.locale.iso_code contains 'pt'
    assign is_pt = true
  endif

  comment
    routes.root_url vaut '/' sur la locale primaire et '/fr' sur les autres.
    Concatener tel quel donnerait '//pages/science', une URL protocol-relative
    que le navigateur resoudrait vers l'hote 'pages'.
  endcomment
  assign locale_root = routes.root_url
  if locale_root == '/'
    assign locale_root = ''
  endif

  assign hub_url = pages['academy'].url
  if hub_url == blank
    assign hub_url = locale_root | append: '/pages/academy'
  endif

  assign how_url = pages['comment-ca-marche'].url
  if how_url == blank
    assign how_url = locale_root | append: '/pages/comment-ca-marche'
  endif

  assign benefits_url = pages['benefits'].url
  if benefits_url == blank
    assign benefits_url = locale_root | append: '/pages/benefits'
  endif

  assign wl_url = pages['wavelengths'].url
  if wl_url == blank
    assign wl_url = locale_root | append: '/pages/wavelengths'
  endif

  assign science_url = pages['science'].url
  if science_url == blank
    assign science_url = locale_root | append: '/pages/science'
  endif

  assign howto_url = pages['how-to-use'].url
  if howto_url == blank
    assign howto_url = locale_root | append: '/pages/how-to-use'
  endif

  assign faq_url = pages['faq'].url
  if faq_url == blank
    assign faq_url = locale_root | append: '/pages/faq'
  endif

  assign values_url = pages['nos-valeurs'].url
  if values_url == blank
    assign values_url = locale_root | append: '/pages/nos-valeurs'
  endif

  comment
    Le blog par defaut de Shopify a le handle 'news'. On accepte 'journal' en
    premier pour les boutiques qui ont renomme le leur.
  endcomment
  assign learn_blog = blogs['journal']
  if learn_blog.url == blank
    assign learn_blog = blogs['news']
  endif
  assign blog_url = learn_blog.url
  if blog_url == blank
    assign blog_url = locale_root | append: '/blogs/news'
  endif

  if is_fr
    assign label_benefits = 'Les bienfaits'
    assign label_how = 'Comment &ccedil;a marche'
    assign label_wl = "Longueurs d'onde"
    assign label_science = 'Science'
    assign label_howto = "Mode d'emploi"
    assign label_faq = 'FAQ'
    assign label_values = 'Nos valeurs'
    assign label_blog = 'Blog'
    assign nav_label = 'Sections Apprendre'
  elsif is_pt
    assign label_benefits = 'Os benef&iacute;cios'
    assign label_how = 'Como funciona'
    assign label_wl = 'Comprimentos de onda'
    assign label_science = 'Ci&ecirc;ncia'
    assign label_howto = 'Como usar'
    assign label_faq = 'FAQ'
    assign label_values = 'Os nossos valores'
    assign label_blog = 'Blog'
    assign nav_label = 'Sec&ccedil;&otilde;es Aprender'
  else
    assign label_benefits = 'Benefits'
    assign label_how = 'How it works'
    assign label_wl = 'Wavelengths'
    assign label_science = 'Science'
    assign label_howto = 'How to use'
    assign label_faq = 'FAQ'
    assign label_values = 'Our values'
    assign label_blog = 'Blog'
    assign nav_label = 'Learn sections'
  endif
-%}

<nav class="ln-subnav" aria-label="{{ nav_label }}">
  <div class="ln-shell ln-subnav__inner">
    <a class="ln-subnav__home" href="{{ hub_url }}">{% if is_fr %}Apprendre{% elsif is_pt %}Aprender{% else %}Learn{% endif %}</a>
    <a class="ln-subnav__link{% if current == 'benefits' %} is-current{% endif %}" href="{{ benefits_url }}"{% if current == 'benefits' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ label_benefits }}</a>
    <a class="ln-subnav__link{% if current == 'how' %} is-current{% endif %}" href="{{ how_url }}"{% if current == 'how' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ label_how }}</a>
    <a class="ln-subnav__link{% if current == 'wavelengths' %} is-current{% endif %}" href="{{ wl_url }}"{% if current == 'wavelengths' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ label_wl }}</a>
    <a class="ln-subnav__link{% if current == 'science' %} is-current{% endif %}" href="{{ science_url }}"{% if current == 'science' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ label_science }}</a>
    <a class="ln-subnav__link{% if current == 'howto' %} is-current{% endif %}" href="{{ howto_url }}"{% if current == 'howto' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ label_howto }}</a>
    <a class="ln-subnav__link{% if current == 'faq' %} is-current{% endif %}" href="{{ faq_url }}"{% if current == 'faq' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ label_faq }}</a>
    <a class="ln-subnav__link{% if current == 'values' %} is-current{% endif %}" href="{{ values_url }}"{% if current == 'values' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ label_values }}</a>
    <a class="ln-subnav__link{% if current == 'blog' %} is-current{% endif %}" href="{{ blog_url }}"{% if current == 'blog' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ label_blog }}</a>
  </div>
</nav>
